      "constraints": [
        "Time limit: 2 sec; Memory limit: 1024 MiB; Constraints: 1 \\leq N \\leq 2 \\times 10^5; 1 \\leq Q \\leq 2 \\times 10^5; 1 \\leq A_i \\leq 10^6 (1 \\leq i \\leq N); B_i is 1 or 2. (1 \\leq i \\leq N); 1 \\leq W_k \\leq N (1 \\leq k \\leq Q); 1 \\leq X_k \\leq 10^6 (1 \\leq k \\leq Q); Y_k is 1 or 2. (1 \\leq k \\leq Q); All input values are integers."
